  "historyNote": "#5053, eff 1-24-91; ss by #5886, eff 8-26-94; amd by #6384-B, eff 11-26-96; ss by #7333, eff 8-1-00; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; amd by #10205, eff 10-19-12; ss by #12347, eff 8-14-17 (formerly Env-Hw 507.01); ss by #14280, eff 8-1-25, EXPIRES: 8-1-35 (formerly Env-Hw 507.02(b)(2)-(g))",
